sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant CEM as CentralEventManager
    participant RC as THREE.Raycaster
    participant LUT as Lookup-Table
    participant HM as HighlightManager

    User->>Browser: Maus bewegt sich (mousemove)

    Browser->>CEM: mousemove Event

    note over CEM: Hover-Throttling\nEvent nur alle 50ms verarbeiten\n= 20 Checks pro Sekunde

    CEM->>CEM: NDC-Normalisierung\nPixel (x,y) → NDC (-1 bis +1)

    CEM->>RC: setFromCamera(ndc, camera)
    RC->>RC: Strahl von Kamera\ndurch NDC-Punkt\nin 3D-Unendlichkeit

    RC->>RC: intersectObject(instancedMesh)
    RC-->>CEM: Treffer: { instanceId: 47, distance: 12.3 }

    CEM->>LUT: resolve(instanceId: 47)
    LUT-->>CEM: entityId: "node_einstein"

    CEM->>HM: setHover("node_einstein")
    HM->>HM: Material-Backup erstellen
    HM->>HM: Helligkeit +30% setzen

    User->>Browser: Maustaste druecken (mousedown)
    Browser->>CEM: mousedown + Koordinaten puffern

    User->>Browser: Maustaste loslassen (mouseup)
    Browser->>CEM: mouseup + neue Koordinaten

    CEM->>CEM: Distanz berechnen\n= sqrt(dx² + dy²)

    alt Distanz < 5 Pixel
        CEM->>CEM: KLICK erkannt
        CEM->>HM: setSelection("node_einstein")
        HM->>HM: Glow + Breathing-Animation
    else Distanz > 5 Pixel
        CEM->>CEM: DRAG erkannt\nKlick ignoriert\nnur Kamera-Rotation
    end
